            "title": "service_ocr_page",
            "description": "if page.needs_ocr: reads the page with OCR. app/features/feature_ingest/handlers/handle_ingest_documents.py:55\n→ await service_ocr_page (if scanned page: OCR)\nEvidence: app/features/feature_ingest/handlers/handle_ingest_documents.py:55  text = await service_ocr_page(pdf, page.page, ocr)",
            "showInDiagram": true,
            "order_no": 4
